<title>PHILIPPINES: Shell Manila unit hikes petroleum product prices.</title>
<headline>Shell Manila unit hikes petroleum product prices.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pilipinas Shell Petroleum Corp raised the price of its petroleum products by an average of 23 centavos per litre effective on August 1, its president Oscar Reyes said on Thursday.</p>
<p>He told reporters the increase was necessary to cover the increase in the firm's foreign exchange costs due to the drop of the peso.</p>
<p>Pilipinas Shell is a subsidiary of Royal Dutch/Shell.</p>
</text>
